{"signature": "{\"text\": \"There are four ways in which energy can be transferred: mechanically, when a force does work; electrically, when charges move through a potential difference; by heating, because of a temperature difference; and by radiation, including electromagnetic waves and sound waves. Remember that light and sound are transfer mechanisms, not energy stores. To describe an energy change, identify the initial store, the transfer pathway and the final store.\", \"voice\": \"en-NG-AbeoNeural\", \"rate\": \"-4%\", \"eleven\": true}", "duration": 29.988571, "words": [["There", 0.0], ["are", 0.36], ["four", 0.546], ["ways", 0.871], ["in", 1.324], ["which", 1.498], ["energy", 1.776], ["can", 2.229], ["be", 2.426], ["transferred:", 2.554], ["mechanically,", 3.471], ["when", 4.505], ["a", 4.76], ["force", 4.865], ["does", 5.19], ["work;", 5.445], ["electrically,", 6.235], ["when", 6.966], ["charges", 7.198], ["move", 7.697], ["through", 7.999], ["a", 8.278], ["potential", 8.359], ["difference;", 8.905], ["by", 9.764], ["heating,", 10.054], ["because", 10.577], ["of", 10.971], ["a", 11.099], ["temperature", 11.204], ["difference;", 11.749], ["and", 12.678], ["by", 12.922], ["radiation,", 13.177], ["including", 14.234], ["electromagnetic", 15.012], ["waves", 16.022], ["and", 16.405], ["sound", 16.602], ["waves.", 16.974], ["Remember", 17.903], ["that", 18.414], ["light", 18.669], ["and", 19.064], ["sound", 19.284], ["are", 19.76], ["transfer", 19.969], ["mechanisms,", 20.48], ["not", 21.363], ["energy", 21.641], ["stores.", 22.094], ["To", 23.197], ["describe", 23.394], ["an", 23.94], ["energy", 24.091], ["change,", 24.544], ["identify", 25.217], ["the", 26.007], ["initial", 26.146], ["store,", 26.587], ["the", 27.33], ["transfer", 27.504], ["pathway", 28.038], ["and", 28.619], ["the", 28.805], ["final", 28.932], ["store.", 29.327]], "raw": [{"text": "There", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.325}, {"text": "are", "start": 0.36, "end": 0.476}, {"text": "four", "start": 0.5